+
+---
+
+## Parallel Example: User Story 1
+
+```bash
+# Two developers, after Phase 2 lands:
+# Dev A — writes the failing happy-path test:
+Task: "Add happy-path test_refund_happy_path in tests/test_refunds.py"
+# Dev B — implements the endpoint:
